    "All seven instrumented cases pass; this does not supersede failed ordinary qualification.",
    "MAX-RECORD Apply occupies 90.0531 ms within a 110.79828 ms gap; original periodic observer reports 90.8 ms excess delay for that gap.",
    "MAX-WIDGETS restore and 40 ms form timer occupy 73.44621 ms and 68.50125 ms respectively; native draw reaches 45.52956 ms.",
    "2476 of 2798 invocations report CPU greater than wall; preserve raw clocks but do not infer CPU utilization, blocked duration or scheduling cause from their difference.",
